{"messages":[{"content":"LangGraph 是一个由 LangChain 团队开发的开源框架，专为构建状态化、多智能体或复杂逻辑的 LLM 应用而设计。它通过有向图（DAG）模型将任务分解为节点和边，允许你显式控制执行流程、管理中间状态并实现循环迭代，从而突破传统链式调用的线性限制。对于后端工程师而言，其核心价值在于提供了类似工作流引擎的确定性控制能力，便于处理需要持久化、人工介入或复杂分支判断的生产级 AI 场景。","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":113,"prompt_tokens":178,"total_tokens":291,"completion_tokens_details":null,"prompt_tokens_details":null},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"demo-model-flash","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"cfe2d8ac75ac4dfaadbaf6f44f841062","finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","id":"lc_run--01a1823e-a87c-7e52-b0fc-36da46850e55-0","tool_calls":[],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":178,"output_tokens":113,"total_tokens":291,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{}}}]}
